        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also compete with market research firms and technology solutions which provide survey-based, general market research or voice of the customer feedback capabilities and firms that provide services or products that complement healthcare performance such as healthcare software or information systems.",
        "start_character": 20587,
        "end_character": 20888
      },
      {
